ons, including types with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bitfields and unnamed fields."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/using-imported-c-structs-and-unions-in-swift","role":"article","title":"Using Imported C Structs and Unions in Swift"}}}